{"nodes": [{"id": "incoming_build185_parts_read_32a_read_32a", "label": "READ-32a - the origin of three totals", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/READ-32a.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "incoming_build185_parts_read_32a_r2_32a", "label": "r2-32a.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/READ-32a.md", "source_location": "L3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "22,360 B / 15a9047af4a637eb7bdb05d0ea982878 / 306 lines, golden r2-32a.out 16,587 B / 0d5d75a2 / 179 lines. Reads the six volumes and Prints & Proofs as members; deterministic."}, {"id": "incoming_build185_parts_read_32a_section_32_1_4", "label": "Section 32.1.4 and its three totals", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/READ-32a.md", "source_location": "L21-L56", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The record's sequence is 55, 47, 48, 47 and is NOT monotone - the record has it at 47 before it has it at 48. Register 375's 47 is 332's figure restated after 373 printed a higher one, not a further movement down."}, {"id": "incoming_build185_parts_read_32a_register_332", "label": "Register 332 - the press readout", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/READ-32a.md", "source_location": "Register L1231", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "States in terms that the total is a readout the press prints at every build - 47 at the time of writing, having been 55 when the section was first computed. So the 47 does not enter the record at 375; it is there at 332, before 373 printed 48."}, {"id": "incoming_build185_parts_read_32a_register_375", "label": "Register 375", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/READ-32a.md", "source_location": "Register L1387", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Restates 332's figure while discharging section 2.21, rather than originating it."}, {"id": "incoming_build185_parts_read_32a_finding_32a01", "label": "Finding 32a-01 - 26c-02's wording is corrected", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/READ-32a.md", "source_location": "L58-L64", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The replacement shape sentence has TWO sites, both in the Register - entries 332 and 375 - and zero in any chapter, the other four compendia or Prints & Proofs. What is true is narrower: section 32.1.4 does not carry it. A claim about a volume is not a claim about a section."}, {"id": "incoming_build185_parts_read_32a_finding_32a02a", "label": "Finding 32a-02a - inputs must be printed at one state", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/READ-32a.md", "source_location": "L82-L86", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only (4, 5, 21, 17) agrees with the shape sentence, and it mixes two states: the numbers index at 21 is 32.1.4.1's before-compression column while E(Q) unfibred at 5 is register 396's readout after compression. Three totals stand at once because the record prints components from four states and a total from three of them."}, {"id": "incoming_build185_parts_read_32a_numbers_index_py", "label": "numbers-index.py (not a member)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/READ-32a.md", "source_location": "L88-L101", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Register 435 records it and densities.py as having been absent and rebuilt from the printed rules. So the origin of the 47 is a reconstruction of an absent instrument, the reconstruction is not held either, and the total cannot be re-derived from the artefact as delivered."}, {"id": "incoming_build185_parts_read_32a_build_py", "label": "build.py - the prose-substitution press", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/READ-32a.md", "source_location": "L96-L100", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A member, but computes none of the arithmetic: 919 lines of markdown/pandoc repair plus a substitution table whose job is to strip script names out of reader-facing prose."}], "edges": [{"source": "incoming_build185_parts_read_32a_read_32a", "target": "incoming_build185_parts_read_32a_r2_32a", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/READ-32a.md", "source_location": "L3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "incoming_build185_parts_read_32a_read_32a", "target": "incoming_build185_parts_read_32a_section_32_1_4", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/READ-32a.md", "source_location": "L21", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "incoming_build185_parts_read_32a_section_32_1_4", "target": "incoming_build185_parts_read_32a_register_332", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/READ-32a.md", "source_location": "L35-L41", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "incoming_build185_parts_read_32a_register_375", "target": "incoming_build185_parts_read_32a_register_332", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/READ-32a.md", "source_location": "L54-L56", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "incoming_build185_parts_read_32a_section_32_1_4", "target": "incoming_docket_152_ruling_docket_152_register_373", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "incoming/BUILD185-PARTS/READ-32a.md", "source_location": "L28-L33", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "incoming_build185_p